DETERMINISM WAS NEITHER ESTABLISHED NOR REFUTED. The run stopped before any of
the 25 queries completed, on an engine defect: nnmcts.send_message() dereferences
`window` with no None guard, and it is called every MCTS_TRIAL_CHUNK = 20 trials,
so pick_move(game, window=None) raises for ANY trials >= 20. No result was
collected, so g2_raw_results.json does not exist -- its absence is part of the
record.

The probe FAILED CLOSED (exit 1) and its comparator self-test passed 4/4 before
the engine raised. The engine was NOT modified; the clone is git-clean.

